+| POST | `/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` | `{"toOrgId"}` → 200 `{"id","orgId"}` |
+
+Transfer (group-company move): caller must be an org admin of `{orgID}` (other
+org → 404, non-admin → 403). The user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404);
